        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Hurtful Critique"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, linguistic, mental)\n\nThe sharpshooter makes witty, but disparaging comments about the fighting style of a target within 30 feet, expressing sympathy over every missed blow and providing sarcastic advice on how to improve. The target must succeed at a 18 Will save or take a \u20131 circumstance penalty to attack rolls (\u20132 on a critical failure) for 1 minute or until it makes a successful Strike against the sharpshooter. A creature who critically succeeds or who Strikes the sharpshooter after failing is immune to that sharpshooter's Hurtful Critique for 1 hour."
            },
